{%- comment -%}
  Card variant 6/6 (sections/5dla_collection-product-grid.liquid's
  `product_card_type` setting picks between 5dla_product-card-1/2/3/4/5/6).
  Ported 1:1 (markup + CSS) from the reference's `article.other-tempo-card`
  inside `section.other-tempo-section` (html/revamp-collection/rendered/
  Fusion TEMPO! Wind-Tunnel Performance & Pro Racing _ 5DLA.html).

  `c5dla-card-6` on the root element is this variant's CSS prefix (see
  client/ver_2_0/scss/collection/_product-card-6.scss), same convention as
  card 1/2/3/4/5.

  Font: Jost - inherited from the scope-wide `:root` rule in
  collection.scss (self-hosted from client/ver_2_0/fonts/Jost/static), not
  re-declared here, same convention as card 2/3/4/5.

  Data mapping (per request, .other-tempo-card element - p/h3/a are direct
  children in the reference, no copy wrapper unlike card 5):
  - p: no data source specified - dummy placeholder text.
  - h3: product.title.
  - a (all anchors - image link, title link, "VIEW PRODUCT" link):
    product.url.

  Image (not in the mapping list but part of "migrate article.
  other-tempo-card"): current_variant.featured_image, falling back to
  product.featured_media, same convention as card 1/2/3/4/5.

  Expects: product, swatch_limit (unused here - kept for a consistent
  render signature with 5dla_product-card-1/2/3/4/5.liquid)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign current_media = current_variant.featured_image | default: product.featured_media
-%}

<article class="other-tempo-card c5dla-card-6">
  <a class="other-tempo-image" href="{{ product.url }}">
    {%- if current_media -%}
      <img
        src="{{ current_media | image_url: width: 800 }}"
        alt="{{ current_media.alt | default: product.title | escape }}"
        loading="lazy"
        width="800"
        height="{{ 800 | divided_by: current_media.aspect_ratio }}"
      >
    {%- endif -%}
  </a>
  {%- comment -%} No category/eyebrow data source yet - dummy placeholder. {%- endcomment -%}
  <p>RACE-DAY ESSENTIAL</p>
  <h3><a href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.title }}</a></h3>
  <a class="other-tempo-link" href="{{ product.url }}">
    VIEW PRODUCT
    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path>
    </svg>
  </a>
</article>
